 so you don't accidentally target your friends.\nIn addition to the combat help, the script provides a lot of useful visual information. You can use the ESP feature to see where other players and weapons are located through walls, or use the FreeCam mode to scout the map from any angle. The interface is very organized and easy to understand and control, allowing you to change colors and customize the look of your crosshair. It even shows you helpful server details like how long the game has been running and which region you are playing in, making it a complete package for improving your gameplay.","tags":["Aimbot","Silentaim","Universal","ESP","All in one"],"discord":"https://discord.gg/DS5fJ93Haj","keyLink":"https://linkvertise.com/3143565/zFKxM0auNftY","owner":{"_id":"6989602335987d06cff7a332","username":"404Insane","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/2858490acec002450a1b73da8d5510bd4e6c2ef74739a84ed6a45daaf250717a.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6989602335987d06cff7a332-1771619786549.jpg"},"status":"offline","id":"6989602335987d06cff7a332","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/2858490acec002450a1b73da8d5510bd4e6c2ef74739a84ed6a45daaf250717a.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6989602335987d06cff7a332-1771619786549.jpg"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-20T02:43:49.703Z","last":"","win":14,"math":3},"isHub":true,"supportedGames":[{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d3e","gameId":155615604,"placeId":155615604,"name":"Prison Life","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/4d971323d4e760c0ab14aa8b1d4cf37289a279ff54af135ecbeaeb6cf138497b.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-fee67c1f98361eac15c13f80b03592ae/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me